 "name_en": "Purchase Order Accruals (2VB)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Purchase Order Accruals (2VB)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe6bcbfbc68b84c938b398b37ae36e664\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe6bcbfbc68b84c938b398b37ae36e664__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Accruals must be posted when liabilities are occurred to a third party and related costs are not yet posted. This solution supports the typical period-end closing activity – accruals postings with the reference to purchase orders. You can also choose to activate the deferrals solution in Purchase Order Accruals to let accruals and deferrals for a purchase order seamlessly work together with automation.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Based on the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> accrual engine, this solution offers flexible configuration options for calculating and posting the purchase order accruals. It also provides the option to review the monthly accrual amounts and supports monitoring and the approval of accruals.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe6bcbfbc68b84c938b398b37ae36e664__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage workflows for purchase order accruals review</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer purchase orders (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Propose periodic accruals</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">My inbox – Review purchase order accruals</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review purchase order accruals for cost accountant</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post periodic accruals</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze accrual postings</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe6bcbfbc68b84c938b398b37ae36e664__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Get comprehensive automation of process chains for purchase order accruals</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce efforts in manual work</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>采购订单应计 (2VB)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe6bcbfbc68b84c938b398b37ae36e664\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe6bcbfbc68b84c938b398b37ae36e664__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">当第三方发生负债且相关成本尚未过账时，必须过账应计。此解决方案支持参考采购订单的典型期末关账活动 - 应计过账。您还可以选择激活采购订单应计中的递延解决方案，以使采购订单的应计和递延与自动化无缝协作。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">基于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 应计引擎，此解决方案为计算和过账采购订单应计提供了灵活的配置选项。它还提供了审核每月应计金额的选项，并支持应计的监控和审批。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe6bcbfbc68b84c938b398b37ae36e664__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">管理采购订单应计审核的工作流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">传输采购订单（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">建议定期应计</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">我的收件箱 - 审核采购订单应计</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审核成本会计的采购订单应计</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账定期应计</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析应计过账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe6bcbfbc68b84c938b398b37ae36e664__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">全面实现流程链自动化，实现采购订单应计</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少手动工作量</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
